    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u0627\u0646\u0627 \u0645\u0637\u0648\u0631 \u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a \u0645\u0633\u062a\u0642\u0644 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0627\u0642\u060c \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u062a\u062a\u0643\u0644\u0645 \u0639\u0646 \u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0633\u0645\u0647\u0627 &quot;\u0644\u064a\u0646&quot;. \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0635\u0629 \u062a\u0628\u062f\u0623 \u0628\u0634\u062e\u0635 \u0627\u0633\u0645\u0647 &quot;\u062f\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0631 \u0633\u0643\u0648\u064a\u0631&quot;\u060c \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062e\u0635 \u0635\u0646\u0639 \u062a\u0631\u064a\u0627\u0642 \u0648\u0635\u0627\u0631 \u0642\u0648\u064a \u0648\u062f\u0645\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645 \u0628\u062a\u062c\u0627\u0631\u0628\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0637\u064a\u0631\u0629. \u0647\u062f\u0641 &quot;\u0644\u064a\u0646&quot; \u0647\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0646\u062a\u0642\u0627\u0645 \u0645\u0646 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0631\u064a\u0631\u060c \u0648\u0644\u0643\u0646 \u0644\u0644\u0623\u0633\u0641 \u064a\u0646\u0647\u0632\u0645 &quot;\u0644\u064a\u0646&quot; \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062f\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0631 \u064a\u0642\u0636\u064a \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647. <br>\u0644\u0643\u0646 \u062a\u0645 \u0627\u062e\u062a\u064a\u0627\u0631 &quot;\u0644\u064a\u0646&quot; \u0644\u0625\u0646\u0642\u0627\u0630 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u060c \u0648\u0628\u0637\u0631\u064a\u0642\u0629 \u0645\u0627 \u064a\u0646\u062a\u0642\u0644 \u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645 \u0622\u062e\u0631 \u0648\u064a\u062f\u062e\u0644 \u0641\u064a \u0645\u0639\u0627\u0631\u0643 \u0635\u0639\u0628\u0629\u060c \u062b\u0645 \u064a\u0646\u062a\u0642\u0644 \u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645 \u0622\u062e\u0631 \u0648\u062a\u0628\u062f\u0623 \u0642\u0635\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0646\u062a\u0642\u0627\u0645 \u0645\u0646 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0631.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u062a\u0641\u0627\u0635\u064a\u0644 \u062e\u0627\u0631\u062c \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0635\u0629:</strong><br>\u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0641\u064a\u0647\u0627 \u0645\u062d\u0631\u0643 \u0644\u062a\u0635\u0645\u064a\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0644. \u064a\u0639\u0646\u064a \u0625\u0630\u0627 \u062e\u0644\u0635\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0648\u062d\u0628\u064a\u062a \u062a\u0633\u0648\u064a \u0645\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0644\u060c \u062a\u0642\u062f\u0631 \u062a\u0635\u0645\u0645 \u0645\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0644 \u0648\u062a\u0628\u0631\u0645\u062c \u062f\u0627\u062e\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629\u060c \u0648\u062d\u062a\u0649 \u062a\u0642\u062f\u0631 \u062a\u0633\u0648\u064a \u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u062f\u0627\u062e\u0644 \u0644\u0639\u0628\u062a\u064a \u0648\u062a\u0646\u0634\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u062d\u0644\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062f\u064a\u0633\u0643\u0648\u0631\u062f \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0627\u0635 \u0628\u0633\u064a\u0631\u0641\u0631\u064a.<br>\u0631\u0627\u062d \u062a\u0638\u0647\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u062d\u0644\u0629 \u062f\u0627\u062e\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u062a\u0644\u0642\u0627\u0626\u064a\u064b\u0627 \u0644\u0623\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u064a\u0631\u0641\u0631 \u0645\u0631\u062a\u0628\u0637 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0639\u0646 \u0637\u0631\u064a\u0642 \u0628\u0648\u062a \u064a\u0627\u062e\u0630 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0644 \u0648\u064a\u0646\u0634\u0631\u0647\u0627 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0634\u0631\u0629.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0634\u0643\u0631\u064b\u0627 \u0644\u0643 \u0644\u0623\u0646\u0643 \u0644\u0639\u0628\u062a \u0644\u0639\u0628\u062a\u064a.<br>\u0644\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0644\u0648\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0639\u0645\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0633\u0646\u062a\u064a\u0646:))<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/c0072cbf2e4b24a220b44acd1d5f3438.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>___________________________________________________________</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/547c2f5c61a49236f68c5710776fa278.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins with a tragic tale of a scientist whose reckless experiments led to the destruction of the world, plunging it into chaos and pollution. The protagonist, <strong>Lean</strong>, loses everything he holds dear\u2014his family and his beloved\u2014in the aftermath. Consumed by grief and rage, Lean embarks on a journey of revenge. However, after a climactic battle with the scientist, Lean is defeated and left for dead. Just as all hope seems lost, a mysterious hero intervenes, saving Lin and transporting him to a parallel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this surreal and otherworldly realm, Lean must complete <strong>four unique stages</strong> to collect <strong>Gate Tokens</strong>, which are essential for repairing the portal back to his world. Once the portal is restored, Lean returns to his original world with newfound powers, ready to continue his quest for vengeance. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/026d03a7df0ec9ba11728d82bdd814e9.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/74ae58187ec0825b121b18e189d4d3c4.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade unique powers to enhance combat and exploration. As you progress, you\u2019ll gain access to devastating abilities that change the way you approach battles and challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/f0fe4e070722b8c717d00a0ab53f31ad.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fully interactive battles with complete freedom of movement. Every encounter is designed to be strategic and immersive, allowing you to adapt your tactics on the fly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/e9af4ef331728c11d6b146333fbab58f.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with a built-in level design tool. Create custom levels, add your own images and music, and even program new gameplay mechanics. The possibilities are endless!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/16f498f3f44e3da31181d7edfcc9712b.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your custom-designed levels directly through a Discord server. Levels uploaded to the server will automatically appear in the game, allowing other players to download and play them seamlessly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/7bde3249b139b783fafd704578c933ee.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on additional tasks that offer unique rewards and expand the overall experience. These missions provide deeper insights into the game\u2019s world and characters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/f649a6daea0e18c4f1db64ba1cb9600a.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>full version</strong> of the game includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All four stages</strong> of the parallel world, each with unique challenges and environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional supernatural abilities</strong> to unlock and master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More side missions</strong> and character customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced level design tools</strong>, including advanced programming options for creating complex gameplay mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Discord integration</strong>, enabling a thriving community of level creators and players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/c848d50a9ee7a055f32cefa9be1dc3a9.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines <strong>intense action</strong>, <strong>emotional storytelling</strong>, and <strong>unprecedented creative freedom</strong>. With its innovative level design engine and Discord integration, it offers a unique experience that bridges the gap between players and creators. Whether you\u2019re here for the story, the combat, or the creativity, this game has something for everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/c29b5e8589296fe708ad44099997e277.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on Lin\u2019s quest for vengeance, explore a surreal parallel world, and unleash your creativity with the level design engine. The adventure awaits\u2014dive into the full version and experience everything this game has to offer!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/68b72db63e00b89c947b136624e19ffc.poster.avif?t=1755374877\" width=400 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/68b72db63e00b89c947b136624e19ffc.webm?t=1755374877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/68b72db63e00b89c947b136624e19ffc.mp4?t=1755374877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u0627\u0646\u0627 \u0645\u0637\u0648\u0631 \u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a \u0645\u0633\u062a\u0642\u0644 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0627\u0642\u060c \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u062a\u062a\u0643\u0644\u0645 \u0639\u0646 \u0634\u062e\u0635\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0633\u0645\u0647\u0627 &quot;\u0644\u064a\u0646&quot;. \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0635\u0629 \u062a\u0628\u062f\u0623 \u0628\u0634\u062e\u0635 \u0627\u0633\u0645\u0647 &quot;\u062f\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0631 \u0633\u0643\u0648\u064a\u0631&quot;\u060c \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062e\u0635 \u0635\u0646\u0639 \u062a\u0631\u064a\u0627\u0642 \u0648\u0635\u0627\u0631 \u0642\u0648\u064a \u0648\u062f\u0645\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645 \u0628\u062a\u062c\u0627\u0631\u0628\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0637\u064a\u0631\u0629. \u0647\u062f\u0641 &quot;\u0644\u064a\u0646&quot; \u0647\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0646\u062a\u0642\u0627\u0645 \u0645\u0646 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u0631\u064a\u0631\u060c \u0648\u0644\u0643\u0646 \u0644\u0644\u0623\u0633\u0641 \u064a\u0646\u0647\u0632\u0645 &quot;\u0644\u064a\u0646&quot; \u0648\u0627\u0644\u062f\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0631 \u064a\u0642\u0636\u064a \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647. <br>\u0644\u0643\u0646 \u062a\u0645 \u0627\u062e\u062a\u064a\u0627\u0631 &quot;\u0644\u064a\u0646&quot; \u0644\u0625\u0646\u0642\u0627\u0630 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u060c \u0648\u0628\u0637\u0631\u064a\u0642\u0629 \u0645\u0627 \u064a\u0646\u062a\u0642\u0644 \u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645 \u0622\u062e\u0631 \u0648\u064a\u062f\u062e\u0644 \u0641\u064a \u0645\u0639\u0627\u0631\u0643 \u0635\u0639\u0628\u0629\u060c \u062b\u0645 \u064a\u0646\u062a\u0642\u0644 \u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645 \u0622\u062e\u0631 \u0648\u062a\u0628\u062f\u0623 \u0642\u0635\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0646\u062a\u0642\u0627\u0645 \u0645\u0646 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0643\u062a\u0648\u0631.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u062a\u0641\u0627\u0635\u064a\u0644 \u062e\u0627\u0631\u062c \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0635\u0629:</strong><br>\u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0641\u064a\u0647\u0627 \u0645\u062d\u0631\u0643 \u0644\u062a\u0635\u0645\u064a\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0644. \u064a\u0639\u0646\u064a \u0625\u0630\u0627 \u062e\u0644\u0635\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0648\u062d\u0628\u064a\u062a \u062a\u0633\u0648\u064a \u0645\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0644\u060c \u062a\u0642\u062f\u0631 \u062a\u0635\u0645\u0645 \u0645\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0644 \u0648\u062a\u0628\u0631\u0645\u062c \u062f\u0627\u062e\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629\u060c \u0648\u062d\u062a\u0649 \u062a\u0642\u062f\u0631 \u062a\u0633\u0648\u064a \u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u062f\u0627\u062e\u0644 \u0644\u0639\u0628\u062a\u064a \u0648\u062a\u0646\u0634\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u062d\u0644\u0629 \u0641\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062f\u064a\u0633\u0643\u0648\u0631\u062f \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0627\u0635 \u0628\u0633\u064a\u0631\u0641\u0631\u064a.<br>\u0631\u0627\u062d \u062a\u0638\u0647\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u062d\u0644\u0629 \u062f\u0627\u062e\u0644 \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u062a\u0644\u0642\u0627\u0626\u064a\u064b\u0627 \u0644\u0623\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u064a\u0631\u0641\u0631 \u0645\u0631\u062a\u0628\u0637 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0639\u0646 \u0637\u0631\u064a\u0642 \u0628\u0648\u062a \u064a\u0627\u062e\u0630 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0631\u0627\u062d\u0644 \u0648\u064a\u0646\u0634\u0631\u0647\u0627 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0645\u0628\u0627\u0634\u0631\u0629.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0634\u0643\u0631\u064b\u0627 \u0644\u0643 \u0644\u0623\u0646\u0643 \u0644\u0639\u0628\u062a \u0644\u0639\u0628\u062a\u064a.<br>\u0644\u0644\u0645\u0639\u0644\u0648\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0639\u0645\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0628\u0629 \u0633\u0646\u062a\u064a\u0646:))<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/c0072cbf2e4b24a220b44acd1d5f3438.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>___________________________________________________________</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/547c2f5c61a49236f68c5710776fa278.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins with a tragic tale of a scientist whose reckless experiments led to the destruction of the world, plunging it into chaos and pollution. The protagonist, <strong>Lean</strong>, loses everything he holds dear\u2014his family and his beloved\u2014in the aftermath. Consumed by grief and rage, Lean embarks on a journey of revenge. However, after a climactic battle with the scientist, Lean is defeated and left for dead. Just as all hope seems lost, a mysterious hero intervenes, saving Lin and transporting him to a parallel world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this surreal and otherworldly realm, Lean must complete <strong>four unique stages</strong> to collect <strong>Gate Tokens</strong>, which are essential for repairing the portal back to his world. Once the portal is restored, Lean returns to his original world with newfound powers, ready to continue his quest for vengeance. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/026d03a7df0ec9ba11728d82bdd814e9.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/74ae58187ec0825b121b18e189d4d3c4.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade unique powers to enhance combat and exploration. As you progress, you\u2019ll gain access to devastating abilities that change the way you approach battles and challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/f0fe4e070722b8c717d00a0ab53f31ad.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fully interactive battles with complete freedom of movement. Every encounter is designed to be strategic and immersive, allowing you to adapt your tactics on the fly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/e9af4ef331728c11d6b146333fbab58f.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with a built-in level design tool. Create custom levels, add your own images and music, and even program new gameplay mechanics. The possibilities are endless!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/16f498f3f44e3da31181d7edfcc9712b.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your custom-designed levels directly through a Discord server. Levels uploaded to the server will automatically appear in the game, allowing other players to download and play them seamlessly.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>5</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/7bde3249b139b783fafd704578c933ee.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on additional tasks that offer unique rewards and expand the overall experience. These missions provide deeper insights into the game\u2019s world and characters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/f649a6daea0e18c4f1db64ba1cb9600a.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>full version</strong> of the game includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All four stages</strong> of the parallel world, each with unique challenges and environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional supernatural abilities</strong> to unlock and master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More side missions</strong> and character customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced level design tools</strong>, including advanced programming options for creating complex gameplay mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Discord integration</strong>, enabling a thriving community of level creators and players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/c848d50a9ee7a055f32cefa9be1dc3a9.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game combines <strong>intense action</strong>, <strong>emotional storytelling</strong>, and <strong>unprecedented creative freedom</strong>. With its innovative level design engine and Discord integration, it offers a unique experience that bridges the gap between players and creators. Whether you\u2019re here for the story, the combat, or the creativity, this game has something for everyone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/c29b5e8589296fe708ad44099997e277.avif?t=1755374877\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on Lin\u2019s quest for vengeance, explore a surreal parallel world, and unleash your creativity with the level design engine. The adventure awaits\u2014dive into the full version and experience everything this game has to offer!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/68b72db63e00b89c947b136624e19ffc.poster.avif?t=1755374877\" width=400 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/68b72db63e00b89c947b136624e19ffc.webm?t=1755374877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/68b72db63e00b89c947b136624e19ffc.mp4?t=1755374877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a ruthless open-world action RPG: battle relentless foes, conquer epic boss fights, master a deep skill tree, and wield supernatural powers. Survive deadly traps, scavenge resources in gritty survival gameplay, and shape your story-driven fantasy\u2014rise as hero or succumb to chaos.",
